  "description": "The SCOTT Overland 30 is a gravel bike built for every adventure without breaking the bank. For daily commutes to off-road exploration, its alloy frame offers lightweight agility and endurance performance, combined with components and carrying capacity that make any ride one to enjoy.\n\nThe Overland 30 carries everything you need, whether you’re heading out for a quick ride or a multi-day trip. Front-fork mounts hold up to 3kg per side, and the rear rack supports an additional 20kg, so you can pack for overnight camping or longer journeys. If you need more space, an optional front rack adds 10kg of capacity, and top-tube mounts provide quick access to storage for smaller essentials.\n\nVisibility is never an issue, thanks to front and rear lights powered by a dynamo hub. They charge as you pedal, so you can see and be seen without worrying about batteries.\n\nThe Overland 30 comes with 40mm tires, delivering a smooth yet responsive ride that absorbs bumps without feeling soft. Remove the fenders, and the frame can accommodate tires up to 50mm tread, giving you extra volume and grip for rougher routes. The Shimano 10-speed drivetrain offers precise shifting and durability, ensuring a reliable ride over long distances.\n\nWhether you’re navigating city streets, embarking on a tour, or exploring new trails, the Overland 30 is built to adapt to your needs—making it a versatile choice for any adventure.\n\nPlease note that bike specifications are subject to change without prior notice.",
